Quick StartRun the simulation with default Schwarzschild parameters:Bash./build/blackhole --metric kerr --spin 0.95 --resolution 1920x1080 --output render.png
Configuration OptionsPlaintext  -m, --metric <type>       Metric type: 'schwarzschild' or 'kerr' (default: kerr)
  -a, --spin <val>          Black hole dimensionless spin parameter [0.0, 1.0)
  -r, --resolution <WxH>    Output image dimensions (e.g., 3840x2160)
  -s, --steps <count>       Maximum integrator integration steps per ray
  -o, --output <file>       Output destination file path
